    "body": "## Changes\r\n\r\n- **npm minimum release age policy** — adds `.npmrc` with `minimum-release-age=7` so `npm install` rejects packages published less than 7 days ago, reducing exposure to supply-chain attacks via freshly-published malicious versions.\r\n- **protobufjs bump** — updates `protobufjs` (7.5.5 → 7.5.8) and sub-packages (`@protobufjs/codegen`, `@protobufjs/inquire`, `@protobufjs/utf8`) to versions that satisfy the new constraint.",
